					<![CDATA[
						 <p>It's such a refreshing new way of seeing the both of them. In this 106 actually feels fear and tries to resist 173 just like 682 did. We also see that 173 still maintains it's compulsion to break necks even when reduced to his rebar roots.</p> <p>Not to mention that you just killed off the first SCP and gave The Old Man PTSD! Damn! +1</p> 
				 	]]>
